      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- The Linked list give me O(1) in this operation vs an array\n- If the list is empty, the the head and the tail must point to it\n- If the list is not empty, the new node's next node must point to the head\n- Move the head pointer to the new node, the head must point to the new node",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The Linked list give me O(1) in this operation vs an array\n- If the list is empty, the the head and the tail must point to it\n- If the list is not empty, the new node's next node must point to the head\n- Move the head pointer to the new node, the head must point to the new node",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
